  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WHO Health Emergencies Programme in Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WHO is supporting the health sector and continues to work with the Ministry of Health and partners in Ukraine to deliver essential, life-saing health care in the country. WHO strengthens essential trauma and emergency medical services, prioritizing assistance to women.</narrative>
